      "writtenOn": "2019-11-21T17:07:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we should clear PD_EXIT_LOW_POWER_EVENT_MASK in entry to auto toggle since this flag may have been set some other random time when a CC event changed (from line 841). When entering the auto toggle state we should not have any valid wake requests yet since we haven\u0027t engaged low power mode yet.\n\n(the clear must happen before setting LPM_ENGAGED otherwise we can have race conditions between tasks)\n\n(it is good that our flag access is atomic since this would require making the flag variable volatile or using atomic accessors)",
